    "description": "Showcasing a newly imagined interior in an exquisite setting, 1283 Stanyan is an outstanding residence with a modern and delightful floor plan in the heart of Cole Valley. Nestled at the sheltered end of Stanyan Street, where it meets Belgrave Avenue, the home borders the green belt. If you love living connected to nature, the setting is one of one of the elements that distinguishes the residence. The interior highlights include a chef's kitchen, new spa bathrooms, California Closets\u00ae, a coffee nook by the garden, and on the deck, a cedar Japanese soaking tub from Forest Cooperage. 1283 delivers modern conveniences, such as a private home office, laundry, parking with an EV plug, and radiant heating, with finishes by Rejuvenation, RH, Pablo, and Duravit. Almost completely detached, the natural light in the spaces is very beautiful, making this home a one-of-a-kind urban oasis."
